<tr>
<td style="color:inherit; border: solid 1px Silver; padding: 0.6em; background: var(--background-color-base, #fff);">
<figure class="mw-halign-right" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/wiki/File:Royal_Danish_Army_1940.png" class="mw-file-description" title="Structure of the Royal Danish Army, 9 April 1940"><img alt="Structure of the Royal Danish Army, 9 April 1940" src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e1/Royal_Danish_Army_1940.png/300px-Royal_Danish_Army_1940.png" decoding="async" width="300" height="339" class="mw-file-element" srcset="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e1/Royal_Danish_Army_1940.png/450px-Royal_Danish_Army_1940.png 1.5x, //upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e1/Royal_Danish_Army_1940.png/600px-Royal_Danish_Army_1940.png 2x" data-file-width="3319" data-file-height="3750" /></a><figcaption>Structure of the Royal Danish Army, 9 April 1940</figcaption></figure>
<ul><li>Headquarters under <a href="/wiki/Lieutenant_general" title="Lieutenant general">Lieutenant general</a> <a href="/wiki/William_Wain_Prior" title="William Wain Prior">William Wain Prior</a> at <a href="/wiki/Copenhagen" title="Copenhagen">Copenhagen</a>
<ul><li>1st (Zealand) Infantry Division
